# What NOT to ship inside the .vsix.
#
# NOTE: do *not* ignore node_modules/ wholesale. vsce ships only the production
# dependencies, and `vscode-languageclient` is one of them -- excluding the whole
# tree would produce a VSIX that fails at activation.

# TypeScript sources and build config (out/ is what ships)
src/
tsconfig.json
**/*.map

# Previously packaged extensions -- must never be nested inside a new one
*.vsix

# Repo/dev-only artifacts
.gitignore
.vscodeignore
package-lock.json
alan-profile/
icons/*.xcf
